rl":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sanketkedia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":3,"created_at":"2022-10-03T16:45:32Z","updated_at":"2022-12-19T18:00:25Z","closed_at":"2022-12-19T18:00:25Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Jira Link: [DB-3737](https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-3737)\r\n### Description\n\n1. Create an RF1 (I created 3 masters and 1 TS but it shouldn't matter). Also, set the value of `cleanup_split_tablets_interval_sec` gflag to 1, to speed up deletions of parent\r\n2. Create a YCQL table with 1 tablet\r\n3. Insert 10k rows\r\n4. Issue the yb-admin split command to manually split the tablet into 2 tablets\r\n5. Sleep for 5 secs\r\n6. Insert a row in the table, it times out\r\n\r\nTo repro it with an existing unit-test, check `YbAdminRestoreDuringSplit.RestoreBeforeParentHidden`. Just comment out the `ASSERT_OK(cluster_->SetFlagOnTServers(\"TEST_skip_deleting_split_tablets\", \"true\"));`\r\nline. You can also comment out parts of the test that performs a restore subsequently although it does not matter, it fails much before that.\r\n\r\n```\r\nTEST_F(YbAdminRestoreDuringSplit, RestoreBeforeParentHidden) {\r\n  const int kNumRows = 10000;\r\n\r\n  // Create exactly one tserver so that we only have to invalidate one cache.\r\n  SetRf1Flags();\r\n\r\n  auto schedule_id = ASSERT_RESULT(PrepareCql());\r\n\r\n  auto conn = ASSERT_RESULT(CqlConnect(client::kTableName.namespace_name()));\r\n\r\n  // Insert enough data to cause splitting.\r\n  ASSERT_RESULT(CreateTableAndInsertData(&conn, kNumRows));\r\n\r\n  **// Set flag to disable hiding parent. [Comment this out]**\r\n  **// ASSERT_OK(cluster_->SetFlagOnTServers(\"TEST_skip_deleting_split_tablets\", \"true\"));**\r\n\r\n  ASSERT_OK(TriggerManualSplit());\r\n\r\n  std::this_thread::sleep_for(kCleanupSplitTabletsInterval * 5);\r\n\r\n  // Restore time is after split completes but parent does not hide.\r\n  Timestamp time(ASSERT_RESULT(WallClock()->Now()).time_point);\r\n  LOG(INFO) << \"Restore time \" << time.ToHumanReadableTime();\r\n\r\n  \r\n...\r\n}\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/14298/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/14298/timeline","performed_via_github_a